{"about_the_game":"Step into the exciting world of LOVE Hotel Simulator \ud83c\udfe9, a cool resource management game where you take on the role of a proud owner of your very own LOVE Hotel! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/5.gif?t=1744626197\" /><br>Start from scratch, hire staff, fulfill client requests, customize rooms, and turn your business into the most elite destination in town. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/1.gif?t=1744626197\" /><br>Develop your managerial skills, offer extra services, and expand your hotel to new heights. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/4.gif?t=1744626197\" /><br>With first-person gameplay, you'll be fully immersed in the day-to-day operations and challenges of running a successful business.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/3.gif?t=1744626197\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features our players will love:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customizable characters and rooms</strong>. Design unique interiors and create standout looks for your staff to attract more clients.<br></li><li><strong>Skill progression system</strong>. Level up your management abilities to take your hotel to the next level.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic client requests.</strong> Each guest has specific preferences, making every interaction fresh and engaging.<br></li><li><strong>Realistic economy</strong>. Manage your finances carefully to maximize profits and grow your business.<br></li><li><strong>First-person immersion</strong>. Explore your hotel, interact with staff, and solve problems on the go.<br><br>Build the LOVE Hotel of your dreams and show the world you\u2019ve got what it takes to succeed!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.s